 "about": "One tone per status word, everywhere (rule 1 of the v2 visual layer; findings N02, N06). Keys are the pill word lowercased with numbers as n. Tones: green done or satisfied, red failed, late, critical or high, amber partial, moderate or due soon, grey every neutral or waiting state. Blue is never a status. Glyph follows tone: green check, red diamond, amber clock (amber partial: half ring), grey dashed ring. A word not listed falls to the families in core.js (TONE_FAMILY), then to the caller's tone with blue made grey.",
